Error [jet.UnknownTag]: There's no tag called `sum`
  --> tests/ui/unknown_tag_far_word_suggests_nothing.jet:4:8
    |
  4 |     x: #sum { 2 + 3 }
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A value tag must name a declared `tag`
 Fix: Declare it first with `sum: tag { deny: [Effect] }`, or check the spelling
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0733
